  "decision_date": "05/08/2019",
  "description": "Retrospective application for change of use from a house to a letting agents office (Use Class A2) with associated shop front on the ground floor. Erection of a single storey rear and rear roof extension to form a residential unit",
  "site_name": null,
  "last_updated_by": "Northgate M3",
  "decision_target_date": "12/08/2019",
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "postcode": "TW3 1PA",
  "street_name": "Kingsley Road",
  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Other change of use",
  "lapsed_date": "04/08/2022",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (364KR-001; 364KR-002; 364KR-003; 364KR-004; 364KR-005; 364KR-006; Planning, Design and Access Statement; Received 17/06/2019.) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The development hereby permitted shall make provision for cycle parking and refuse/recycling storages to be provided at this site in accordance with the standards embodied in Policy 6.9 of the London Plan and EQ7 of the Local Plan.",
    "Condition : 5 - The ground floor, front part of the premises (the commercial unit) shall only be used for the provision of:-  \r\n(a) financial services \r\n(b) professional services (other than health or medical services), or \r\n(c) any other services (other than use as a driving school office) which it is appropriate to provide in a shopping area, \r\nwhere the services are provided principally to visiting members of the public, and for no other purpose of use (including any purpose or use within Class B1 of the Schedule to the Town and Country Planning (Use Classes) Order 1987), or in any provision equivalent to that Class in any Statutory Instrument revoking, re-enacting or amending that Order.",
    "Condition : 6 - The dwelling hereby approved, as enlarged and/or altered in accordance with this permission, shall only be used as a single unit of accommodation, and shall not be subdivided, separated or altered in any way so as to create two or more separate units of accommodation, without further grant of planning permission, and nor shall any part of it be used for commercial purposes, notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Permitted Development Order 2016 or its successor legislation and the associated Use Classes Order. \r\n",
    "Condition : 7 - The rear garden shall only be used as for the residential unit's amenity space and for no other purpose."
  ],
